C. THE DEFLECTION PER LINK AND SUMMED ALONG THE PATH (Fermat on n = 1 + f k_a: d theta = f (n_s / d_s) x (A(y+1) - A(y-1)) / 2 per Link in x)
   per unit of the pair (n_s / d_s = 1), the lattice's sum over x = 2 .. 54 of the transverse difference of A across the beam's line, against the continuum's 2 f A(b) with A(b) the shell mean at b:
   mass (b = 6), f = 2: the lattice's summed gradient -663.0 per unit pair; the continuum 2 f A(b) = 48.1 (A(b) = 12.0); at the pin pair [1, 4096] and the mass x 16: -2.5898 rad (lattice) against 0.1880 rad (continuum; the design's 0.178)
   mass (b = 6), f = 1: the lattice's summed gradient -331.5 per unit pair; the continuum 2 f A(b) = 24.1 (A(b) = 12.0); at the pin pair [1, 4096] and the mass x 16: -1.2949 rad (lattice) against 0.0940 rad (continuum; the design's 0.178)
