   near (b = 3), f = 1: the lattice's summed gradient +420.0 per unit pair; the continuum 2 f A(b) = 48.1 (A(b) = 24.1); at the pin pair [1, 4096] and the mass x 16: +1.6406 rad (lattice) against 0.1880 rad (continuum; the design's 0.355)
