   The lattice's line sum is the grain's: the beam's line crosses the fan's lines at a few Nodes, where the difference is tens per Link, and reads 0 between them; the continuum's 2 f A(b) is what the shell means give. On the fan the turn is whole steps of THETA_G (2.4 degrees at the smallest), the design's dither over records (gr_rows/DESIGN.md section 4).

D. THE THREE CANDIDATES OF THE OWNER'S HYPOTHESIS, WHAT EACH READS AT b = 6 (M = 2^12), THE CLOCK'S k AND THE ROW'S TURN
   per unit pair: at the beam's Node on the mass's plane the presence word gives k_s = 2.0000, the age word k_a = 21.0000 (the shell mean's k_a(b) = 12.0333)
      (A) the age word for the rows only (optical-v1's verbs on the rows, the clock counting the presence): the row turns by 2 f k_a(b) = 48.1333 rad at f = 2 toward the mass and is delayed as the potential's logarithm; a clock at the same Node runs at 1 / (1 + k_s) = 0.3333, the M / r^2 form that GPS and Galileo refute at two heights: two different fields from one stream for two readers, no one metric
      (B) the age word for the clock only (the law as decided, record 394; the flight blind to the crowd): the row turns 0 (series K's 0.000 stands) and is not delayed; the clock runs at 1 / (1 + k_a) = 0.0767, the potential's form; the bending of light NOT reached, the disagreement with nature (the physicist's entry 2) stands
      (C) the age word for both (clock-age-v1 and optical-v1 with the declared f): one index n = 1 + f k_a for the rows and the clock's 1 + k_a: the row turns by 2 f k_a(b) = 48.1333 rad at f = 2 (24.0667 at f = 1, Newton's), is delayed by (f k_a(b) b / c) ln(4 r1 r2 / b^2), and the clock beside it runs at 1 / (1 + k_a): the time part of the metric is the clock's word, the space part is the second unit of f; the 2 is declared, not derived from the verbs
   the design's pin pair [1, 4096], the mass x 16: at the beam's Node on the mass's plane the presence word gives k_s = 0.0078, the age word k_a = 0.0820 (the shell mean's k_a(b) = 0.0470)
      (A) the age word for the rows only (optical-v1's verbs on the rows, the clock counting the presence): the row turns by 2 f k_a(b) = 0.1880 rad at f = 2 toward the mass and is delayed as the potential's logarithm; a clock at the same Node runs at 1 / (1 + k_s) = 0.9922, the M / r^2 form that GPS and Galileo refute at two heights: two different fields from one stream for two readers, no one metric
      (B) the age word for the clock only (the law as decided, record 394; the flight blind to the crowd): the row turns 0 (series K's 0.000 stands) and is not delayed; the clock runs at 1 / (1 + k_a) = 0.9551, the potential's form; the bending of light NOT reached, the disagreement with nature (the physicist's entry 2) stands
      (C) the age word for both (clock-age-v1 and optical-v1 with the declared f): one index n = 1 + f k_a for the rows and the clock's 1 + k_a: the row turns by 2 f k_a(b) = 0.1880 rad at f = 2 (0.0940 at f = 1, Newton's), is delayed by (f k_a(b) b / c) ln(4 r1 r2 / b^2), and the clock beside it runs at 1 / (1 + k_a): the time part of the metric is the clock's word, the space part is the second unit of f; the 2 is declared, not derived from the verbs

E. WHAT IS DERIVED AND WHAT IS CONDITIONAL, for the owner's question
   derived on the GameBoard: the presence falls as M / r^2 and the age moment as M / r from the same rows (series E: k_s r^2 = 41.5, k_a r = 36.1; the fan's dilution as the shell), the push as minus the gradient of A (5.1), the clock at 1 / (1 + k_a) (5.2, first order), the bending's FORM M / b and its sign from any turn that reads a transverse gradient (the meeting's grain, optical-v1's index), the delay's logarithm from a pace that reads A along the path (optical-v1 verb 1)
   conditional: the factor 2 of Einstein over Newton (declared as f in optical-v1; a derivation would need the space part from the verbs, a row's Link that shortens beside a mass, which no verb of the six gives: the flight table is one speed and the Links are the lattice's), the identification k_a = G M / (r c^2) (the suspension pair sets the scale, nature fixes it by one clock), the field equation beyond the static case (A obeys the retarded scalar wave equation of a stream, 5.1; Einstein's nonlinear equation is not this, 5.5)
